        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious alien creatures – the Beboks – have arrived on Earth to extinguish the most wonderful time of the year. To make matters worse, <strong>Santa and his helpers have been kidnapped</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hope still remains. Take on the role of a brave Snowman – the last defender of Christmas, who embarks on a perilous journey. Save Santa, defeat the invaders, and restore faith in goodness and peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight for the <strong>soul of Christmas</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player campaign with a clear goal: </strong>find Santa and defeat the alien invaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat </strong>– arcade-style melee and ranged combat, requiring quick reflexes,<strong> dodging attacks, and exploiting enemy weaknesses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse locations </strong>– frosty villages, snow-covered forests, icy caves, and alien cosmic spaces, each with its own challenges and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming sequences and challenges – </strong>jumps, traps, and environmental interactions that will test your precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, focused adventure </strong>– perfect for an intense evening or two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions </strong>– all current and future content is included with your purchase.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious alien creatures – the Beboks – have arrived on Earth to extinguish the most wonderful time of the year. To make matters worse, <strong>Santa and his helpers have been kidnapped</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hope still remains. Take on the role of a brave Snowman – the last defender of Christmas, who embarks on a perilous journey. Save Santa, defeat the invaders, and restore faith in goodness and peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight for the <strong>soul of Christmas</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player campaign with a clear goal: </strong>find Santa and defeat the alien invaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat </strong>– arcade-style melee and ranged combat, requiring quick reflexes,<strong> dodging attacks, and exploiting enemy weaknesses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse locations </strong>– frosty villages, snow-covered forests, icy caves, and alien cosmic spaces, each with its own challenges and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming sequences and challenges – </strong>jumps, traps, and environmental interactions that will test your precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, focused adventure </strong>– perfect for an intense evening or two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions </strong>– all current and future content is included with your purchase.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Santa and his helpers have been kidnapped! Mysterious aliens are plotting to destroy the holidays. But hope still remains. Take on the role of a brave Snowman – the last defender of Christmas in a dynamic 2D platformer with arcade combat. Bring back the magic of Christmas!",
